            "Drivers cooperate at roadside inspections; an out-of-service order is obeyed in full (10 h, 8 h or 72 h as declared) and the report is kept."),
        Plan(BasisKeys.Plan5_2, "5.2", "Preventive maintenance (SPM&I)",
